<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7352" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄναρθρ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not differentiated</i> or
				<i>articulated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				75a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				583b10
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>without strength, nerveless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1103
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				228
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>without visible joints,</i>
			like fat men, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of sound,
				<i>inarticulate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψόφοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Sens.</u>
					41
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾠδαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλαλαγμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Mar.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Caes.</u>
				63
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθογγή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.613e
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθέγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					1003
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Memnon</span>). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως</span>”
				<i>confusedly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.611b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>avoiding the use of the article,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμονία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
